---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Safety, Bonding and Prequalification" description="EMR 0.81, $2.5M bonding capacity and a same-day prequalification package." path="/safety/">
<section id="safety"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="safety">
    <div>
      <div class="sec-head" style="margin-bottom:24px">
        <p class="label">Safety</p>
        <h1>Measured, not promised.</h1>
        <p class="lead">OSHA-certified crews, a documented JSA for every site, a utility avoidance plan, daily field reporting, torque logs and QA/QC-stamped assemblies.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="big-pair">
        <div class="metric"><b>0.81</b><span>EMR, 2025</span></div>
        <div class="metric"><b>5 yrs</b><span>Consecutive EMR ≤ 0.85, 2021–2025</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="label">Bonding and insurance</p>
      <dl class="cover">
        <dt>Bonding capacity</dt><dd>$2.5M program</dd>
        <dt>General liability</dt><dd>$1M per occurrence / $2M aggregate</dd>
        <dt>Umbrella / excess</dt><dd>$5M per occurrence / $5M aggregate</dd>
        <dt>Auto liability</dt><dd>$1M combined single limit</dd>
        <dt>Workers' comp</dt><dd>$1M employer's liability</dd>
        <dt>Additional insured / WOS</dt><dd>By endorsement</dd>
      </dl>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem">OSHA 300A summaries, EMR letter, sample COI and bonding letter available on request.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="prequal" id="prequal">
    <div>
      <p class="label">Prequalification</p>
      <h3 style="font-size:1.5rem;margin-top:10px">Get us through vendor onboarding in a day.</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px">Email <b style="color:var(--ink)">info@potentialelectrical.com</b> and we send the full package the same day. Verify our license directly with the <a href="https://www.cslb.ca.gov/OnlineServices/CheckLicenseII/LicenseDetail.aspx?LicNum=996042" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CSLB</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="docs">
      <li>Certificate of insurance (sample)</li><li>EMR letter, 5 years</li><li>OSHA 300A summaries</li><li>Bonding letter</li><li>W-9 and DIR registration</li><li>Safety program and sample JSA</li><li>Utility avoidance plan (sample)</li><li>Daily report (sample)</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div></section>
<div class="ctaband"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Have a plan set? We'll price it.</h2>
  <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request a bid</a>
</div></div>
</Base>
